1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,614
Follow one red cell.

2
00:00:01,614 --> 00:00:11,536
From the body it returns deoxygenated to the right side, is pumped to the lungs, comes back oxygenated to the left side, and is pumped out to the body.

3
00:00:11,536 --> 00:00:15,794
Twice through the heart in one circuit: double circulation.

4
00:00:15,794 --> 00:00:20,963
Closed, and complete, because the two kinds of blood never mix.

